# Tiantasks

`tt` (also `tiantasks`) stores tasks (T-n) and issues (I-n) in a database outside the repo,
grouped by project (the git repo name by default). There is nothing to stage or commit. People
watch a live page (`tt ui` opens it), so your changes show up for them right away.

**Your identity:** run `tt whoami`. On a private board you are `claude`; on a shared board you
