2. **You find a bug, failing test or tech debt you're not fixing now:**
   `tt issue "<one-line summary>" -p <priority> -t <area> -d "<repro or file:line>"`.
3. **You identify follow-up work:** `tt add "<summary>"`. Only use `--to me` (assign yourself)
   if the user asked you to take it on. Assign teammates by name only when asked.
4. **You finish something that matches an open item** (check `tt list`): resolve it with a note.
